      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 02 · Straight from a file, edit, save a multi-track file\nChoose the file in **audio** (a file in `ComfyUI/input`): the timeline shows it at once, no run needed. Edit sections and speakers, then queue: with **save_format** `mka` (or `mov`) the timeline and every speaker are written as one audio stream each into `ComfyUI/output/speakers/`.\n\n**Size:** *save_bit_depth* and *save_sample_rate* set the bitrate (rate × bits × channels); the line under the buttons estimates it. This example saves 16-bit / 22.05 kHz. The duration never changes, whatever you pick. *save_mono* (advanced) halves stereo.\nOnly the first track of a file is analysed; pick another with *track_index* (click a track lane)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
